# Understand-Anything code graph.
# knowledge-graph.json, meta.json, fingerprints.json, config.json and .understandignore
# ARE committed on purpose: with them, a teammate reads the graph without re-running the
# analysis pipeline. Only local scratch is ignored.
.ua/intermediate/
.ua/tmp/
.ua/.trash-*
.ua/diff-overlay.json
